# promise: #663
# A click on the sidebar's address opens Arc's address panel hanging from it, not the centred bar:
# its top left on the field's, as wide as the address (13 pt medium, from 240 to 610 pt) plus
# 110 pt, so a short address gets a panel a little wider than the sidebar and a long one runs
# past it over the page, to Arc's widest, 720 pt. ⌘L keeps the centred bar. Measured in offline Arc 1.174 (20 Nov 2026).
budget rss=600 stalls50=6
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=short
wait 3
cra://debug?urlFieldEdit=click
expect-log url field click: not editing, command bar open, panel compact w=3[5-9][0-9] h=[0-9]+ at field
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=a-much-longer-address-that-runs-well-past-the-sidebar-into-the-page-0123456789
wait 3
cra://debug?urlFieldEdit=click
expect-log url field click: not editing, command bar open, panel compact w=720 h=[0-9]+ at field
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://debug?key=l,37,1048576
wait 1
cra://debug?urlFieldEdit=state
expect-log url field state: not editing, command bar open, panel centred w=
cra://dismiss
